{"nodes": [{"id": "drive_the_method_materials_cowork___the_method_1_6_handoff_cowork_cowork_migration", "label": "Migration of The Method 1.6 into a Claude Cowork project", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/COWORK \u2014 The Method 1.6/HANDOFF-COWORK.md", "source_location": "\u00a71", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Written from chat 143 to carry the project into Cowork while HANDOFF-96 carries the WORK; nothing in the governing files changes, and where this file and a ruling disagree, the ruling governs."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_cowork___the_method_1_6_handoff_cowork_drive_store_of_record", "label": "Drive stays the store of record", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/COWORK \u2014 The Method 1.6/HANDOFF-COWORK.md", "source_location": "\u00a71", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The connector cannot edit an existing Drive file, which matches the regime: a build is always a new upload, never an edit."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_cowork___the_method_1_6_handoff_cowork_gate_and_close_instruments", "label": "The gate and the close travel inside the bundle as members", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/COWORK \u2014 The Method 1.6/HANDOFF-COWORK.md", "source_location": "\u00a71", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "gate.py, close.py, r2lib.py, tower-2.py and the goldens ride in the compendia bundle so nothing needs local installation: the bootstrap extracts them, and the project folder is a scratchpad only."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_cowork___the_method_1_6_handoff_cowork_drive_map", "label": "The Drive map of Materials, bundles and fileIds", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/COWORK \u2014 The Method 1.6/HANDOFF-COWORK.md", "source_